Compiling
~~~~~~~~~
To ease the requirements for compilation and linking, a helper script is 
provided, ${SACHOME}/bin/sac-config, which should output the necessary flags 
and libraries for SAC.  If you have the gcc C compiler or the gfortran Fortran 
compilers, try one of the following::

  gcc -o program main.c subs.c `sac-config --cflags --libs libsac libsacio`

  gfortran -o program main.f subs.f `sac-config --cflags --libs libsac libsacio`


